<title>USA: Gabelli group lifts Fieldcrest stake.</title>
<headline>Gabelli group lifts Fieldcrest stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Wednesday it raised its stake in Fieldcrest Cannon Inc to 12.11 percent or 1,136,599 common shares.</p>
<p>The group made the disclosure in a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The group previously held a 10.9 percent stake in the home textile products manufacturer.</p>
